{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"b5b138cf1dd8da30592a4d2c13dc67ed547cd6116b2047e887ae9805602a4912","slug":"preface","location":"/preface.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"前言","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Jin Lei","given":"Jin","family":"Lei"},"name":"Jin Lei","url":"https://jinlei.fewbody.com","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-0"}],"github":"https://github.com/jinleiphys/atomic","numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/jinleiphys/atomic/blob/main/book/preface.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/jinleiphys/atomic/edit/main/book/preface.md","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"preface.md","url":"/atomic/build/preface-359273e2e6871d027fb9870a1052b0f4.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"在你阅读这段文字的此刻，构成你视网膜的原子正在吸收光子，将电磁波转化为神经信号。构成书页或屏幕的原子正在反射特定波长的光，让文字呈现在你眼前。构成周围空气的原子正以每秒数百米的速度随机碰撞，却在宏观上呈现为静止的透明介质。你从未真正\"看见\"过一个原子，你看见的只是万亿个原子的统计平均效应。你触摸桌面时感受到的\"坚硬\"，不是两块物质的直接接触，而是电子云之间的电磁排斥力。你呼吸的每一口空气、喝下的每一滴水、身体里的每一个细胞，都是原子按照某种规则组装的结果。这些规则是什么？我们又是如何知道它们的？这正是原子物理学要回答的核心问题。","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"Yfo1wtp0ZN"}],"key":"ZDlzJkuFja"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"宇宙的编译器与人类的反编译尝试","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"xIQqOq4mwi"}],"identifier":"id","label":"宇宙的编译器与人类的反编译尝试","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"i7EcmGwzZn"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"想象宇宙是一台巨大的计算机，原子是化学与材料世界的基本处理单元。这台计算机运行着某种\"程序\"，我们称之为物理定律。给定输入条件，无论是初始状态、外加场还是边界约束，程序都会输出相应的结果，可能是能级、光谱、散射分布或衰变率。问题在于，我们看不到程序的源代码，只能观测它的输出。这个隐喻不是文学修辞，而是精确描述了原子物理学家的真实处境。","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"m7NBp5yqJn"}],"key":"TEtXEaYp3T"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"当卢瑟福用 α 粒子轰击金箔时，他输入的是一束已知能量和方向的粒子流，输出的是散射角的统计分布。当光谱学家用棱镜分解氢原子发出的光时，他们输入的是激发能量，输出的是一组离散的频率。当弗兰克和赫兹用电子轰击汞蒸气时，他们输入的是连续变化的电子能量，输出的是电流随电压的阶跃曲线。每一个实验都是一次对黑箱的查询，不同的查询方式探测黑箱的不同侧面。原子物理的核心任务是反编译：从可观测的输出反推不可见的内部结构。","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"bi03x4PUg0"}],"key":"fRHOP27pWi"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"反编译在数学上属于逆问题，与正问题相对。正问题是给定模型计算输出，而逆问题则要从输出反推模型。逆问题通常比正问题困难得多，因为它往往是不适定的：不同的势函数可能产生相同的散射相移，不同的电子配置可能产生相似的光谱。这种多对一的映射关系意味着，仅凭有限的实验数据，我们无法唯一确定微观模型。解决这一困难的方法是引入约束。最强大的约束来自对称性：如果系统具有球对称性，势函数就只能是径向距离的函数；如果系统在时间平移下不变，能量就必须守恒。另一类约束来自简单性原则：当多个模型都能解释现有数据时，我们倾向于选择参数最少、假设最弱的那个。玻尔模型只有一个自由参数，却能解释氢原子的全部光谱线，这种经济性本身就是模型可信度的有力证据。","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"Lim39u74zM"}],"key":"xNhlsSPVeq"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"这里有一个深刻的类比值得展开：物理学家发现定律的过程，与机器学习训练模型的过程，在结构上是同构的。两者的核心都是从有限的、带噪声的数据中，构建一个能够泛化预测的模型。物理学家用的是方程和对称性，机器学习用的是网络结构和损失函数，但认知的骨架是相同的：收集数据，提出模型，前向计算，与实验对照，修正参数或结构，再用新数据验证。这个闭环在物理学中已经运转了四百年，在机器学习中运转了几十年，两者正在深度融合。现代物理学越来越多地使用神经网络拟合势能面，用符号回归发现物理定律；反过来，量子力学也启发了张量网络、量子神经网络等新架构。理解这种同构性，有助于我们用更统一的视角看待人类认识世界的方式。","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"oB1UnIZ0UG"}],"key":"dtaQPptMST"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不同的实验技术可以理解为不同的解码协议。光谱学是最古老也最精确的协议，原子吸收或发射的光子频率对应能级差，通过测量全部谱线可以重构能级图，精度可达 ","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"O2XlJHyQWJ"},{"type":"span","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"10","key":"vAd0CguyLq"},{"type":"superscript","children":[{"type":"text","value":"-15","key":"RDFs2s3JmI"}],"key":"ZzMCGmIwJu"}],"key":"GEnnn826kA"},{"type":"text","value":" 量级。散射实验探测势场的空间结构，入射粒子的波函数被势场扭曲，散射振幅编码了势的傅里叶分量。干涉实验提取相位信息，而相位正是量子力学区别于经典力学的核心。时间分辨测量探测动力学过程，飞秒激光可以追踪化学反应中的原子运动，阿秒脉冲可以捕捉电子的动力学。每一种协议都有其盲区，完整的反编译需要多种协议的组合，就像医学诊断需要综合血液检查、影像学和病理学。","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"yH9sRHmjKf"}],"key":"St4FYE70qd"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"反编译还带来一个重要的认识论教训：我们不需要在每个尺度上都使用\"终极理论\"。考虑一个氢分子，从第一性原理出发需要写下四体薛定谔方程，这个方程没有解析解。但在大多数化学问题中，玻恩-奥本海默近似就足够了，它把核运动和电子运动分离，丢失了一些信息，但在适用范围内足够准确。同样的逻辑贯穿物理学的每一个层次：原子物理用波函数描述电子，不需要追踪夸克；固体物理用能带描述电子，不需要追踪每个原子。每一层都是下一层的有效理论，在适用尺度上正确，在更小尺度上需要被更基本的理论取代。有效理论不是近似的贬义词，而是物理学处理复杂性的核心策略。","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"gdCRBk7ZlF"}],"key":"JnObGRo1D3"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"一场从未被邀请的认知革命","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"WhP54PJNTM"}],"identifier":"id","label":"一场从未被邀请的认知革命","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"d8b0MPGC6h"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1900 年，物理学界弥漫着一种\"终结\"的气氛。牛顿力学统治了两百年，麦克斯韦方程统一了电与磁，热力学奠定了能量守恒的基石。开尔文勋爵宣称物理学的大厦已经基本建成，只剩下\"两朵小乌云\"需要清理。没有人预料到，这两朵乌云会演变成摧毁整座大厦的风暴。","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"PulAEzXPEZ"}],"key":"DiEkOLmJ2j"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"第一朵乌云是黑体辐射。经典理论预言，一个加热的物体应该在高频端辐射出无穷大的能量，这被称为\"紫外灾难\"。普朗克为了拟合实验数据，不得不假设能量的发射是\"一份一份\"的，每一份的大小是 ","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"I9jwqnpgyw"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"E = h\\nu","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = h\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span></span></span></span>","key":"WVn7HWNqpp"},{"type":"text","value":"。他本人并不喜欢这个假设，称之为\"绝望的举动\"。但这个绝望的举动撕开了连续性的面纱，露出了离散的骨骼。第二朵乌云是以太漂移实验的零结果，它最终导向了相对论，但那是另一个故事。","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"dzkkyz8Orp"}],"key":"JtaJqK8Q5D"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"更致命的打击来自原子内部。1911 年，卢瑟福用 α 粒子轰击金箔，发现极少数粒子被大角度散射。他后来回忆说：\"这就像你用一枚 15 英寸的炮弹去轰击一张薄纸，结果炮弹被弹了回来击中了你。\"这个实验迫使他承认：原子的质量集中在一个极小的核心，原子内部几乎是空的。但按照经典电磁学，绕核运动的电子应该不断辐射能量，在 ","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"key":"Lj6Th8HGmW"},{"type":"span","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"10","key":"criHdCWW8l"},{"type":"superscript","children":[{"type":"text","value":"-11","key":"j7HxBEQQKT"}],"key":"LRjrpJbdQ8"}],"key":"dUNhbj1DEt"},{"type":"text","value":" 秒内螺旋坠入原子核。原子应该是不稳定的，物质应该瞬间坍缩。然而物质并没有坍缩。你正坐在椅子上，椅子没有塌陷成一团中子。这个简单的事实，经典物理无法解释。","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"key":"dSFC1KmZ3M"}],"key":"VPnUVsuX1O"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"玻尔的解决方案是大胆而武断的。他假设电子只能存在于特定的轨道上，在这些轨道上它们不辐射能量；只有当电子从一个轨道跃迁到另一个轨道时，才会发射或吸收特定频率的光子。这个假设没有任何经典物理的依据，它是一个纯粹的公理，一个为了拯救现象而硬塞进来的规则。但它成功了，它精确预言了氢原子的光谱线。物理学家们面临一个不舒服的处境：一个没有理论基础的假设，比所有有理论基础的模型都更准确。这意味着什么？这意味着理论基础本身需要被重建。","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"snEMOVXfml"}],"key":"bWoSGHhn3f"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"语言的崩溃与重建","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"key":"ErSlvS9xaJ"}],"identifier":"id","label":"语言的崩溃与重建","html_id":"id-2","implicit":true,"key":"AzOzsjJZyK"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"理解量子革命的深度，必须理解它对语言的摧毁。我们用\"轨道\"描述电子的运动，但电子并没有轨道。我们用\"粒子\"称呼电子，但电子可以同时穿过两条狭缝并与自己干涉。我们用\"位置\"描述物体的所在，但在测量之前，电子并没有确定的位置，它处于所有可能位置的叠加态。我们用\"波\"描述光，但光可以一个一个地打在屏幕上，像子弹一样。每一个日常词汇，在原子尺度上都变成了危险的隐喻。","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"key":"PvbT10LTcz"}],"key":"n5ezn4IEkF"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"海森堡认识到了这一点。1925 年，他在赫尔戈兰岛养病时，做出了一个激进的决定：彻底放弃\"轨道\"的概念，只保留可观测的量，包括能级、跃迁频率和强度，用矩阵来表示它们之间的关系。这套数学形式与经典力学完全不同，其中最惊人的一点是：位置和动量的矩阵不满足交换律，","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"key":"qBn0vw6Lzr"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"xp \\neq px","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xp \\neq px</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span>","key":"higNyvwiPm"},{"type":"text","value":"。这不是数学游戏，这是物理事实：你不能同时精确知道一个粒子在哪里和它要去哪里。","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"key":"nqp07k9rl2"}],"key":"r0l14HzTMw"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"几乎同时，薛定谔从另一条路径出发。他相信德布罗意的物质波假说，试图为电子写一个波动方程。他成功了，薛定谔方程成为量子力学最常用的工具：","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"key":"R52xvRNpI2"}],"key":"ObIUYYqMie"},{"type":"math","value":"i\\hbar \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial t}\\Psi(\\mathbf{r},t) = \\hat{H}\\Psi(\\mathbf{r},t)","position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>H</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i\\hbar \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial t}\\Psi(\\mathbf{r},t) = \\hat{H}\\Psi(\\mathbf{r},t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\">ℏ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.05556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.05556em;\">∂</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>","enumerator":"1","key":"xv1e0wZPRd"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"但波函数 ","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"key":"oY2bQCvctz"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\Psi","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span></span></span></span>","key":"VFzP2jkwjF"},{"type":"text","value":" 是什么？薛定谔最初认为它代表电子\"真实的\"弥散分布，像一团云。玻恩纠正了他：","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"key":"nuemhlb230"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"|\\Psi|^2","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Psi|^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Ψ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>","key":"aBkSU5lxCS"},{"type":"text","value":" 是概率密度，告诉你在某个位置找到电子的概率，而不是电子\"真的\"在那里。","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"key":"Q3oklPZQHj"}],"key":"LHbfItj1fZ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"狄拉克随后证明，海森堡的矩阵力学和薛定谔的波动力学在数学上是等价的，只是同一套理论的不同表述。量子力学由此获得了统一的形式：态由希尔伯特空间中的矢量表示，可观测量由厄米算符表示，测量结果是算符的本征值，测量后系统坍缩到相应的本征态。这套语言精确、自洽、预言能力惊人。但它也彻底颠覆了物理学的哲学基础。在经典物理中，测量是被动的，你只是\"读取\"一个预先存在的值。在量子物理中，测量是主动的，测量行为本身参与了现实的构建。在测量之前，系统没有确定的性质；测量之后，系统被迫\"选择\"一个结果。爱因斯坦至死不愿接受这一点，他著名的反驳是：\"你真的相信月亮只有在你看它的时候才存在吗？\"玻尔的回答是：在原子尺度上，是的。","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"key":"QjqPm0PiB0"}],"key":"gqxRHfE3Xm"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1},"end":{"line":45,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"实验与技术：理论的裁判与文明的引擎","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1},"end":{"line":45,"column":1}},"key":"kMg5ZI2mwR"}],"identifier":"id","label":"实验与技术：理论的裁判与文明的引擎","html_id":"id-3","implicit":true,"key":"Yz1JkLcIuE"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"原子物理从来不是纯粹的思辨，每一个理论突破都由实验驱动，每一个实验突破都由技术进步支撑。真空泵的改进使阴极射线实验成为可能。汤姆孙测量了电子的荷质比，密立根的油滴实验精确测定了电子电荷，这两个数字为原子模型提供了定量基石。光谱仪的精度提升揭示了谱线的精细结构，塞曼效应和斯塔克效应展示了外场对能级的分裂，这些\"异常\"逼迫理论不断修正。","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"key":"cw1wMrvyE5"}],"key":"NKc72o6sXG"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"卢瑟福的散射实验之所以能够进行，依赖于放射性元素提供的 α 粒子源和闪烁屏的计数技术。弗兰克-赫兹实验用电子轰击汞蒸气，观察到能量损失的阶跃，直接证明了能级的存在。戴维孙-革末实验和汤姆孙之子的电子衍射实验证明了电子的波动性，为德布罗意假说提供了决定性的证据。","position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"key":"b3VGfGSsNm"}],"key":"WazW8PkL2S"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"20 世纪下半叶，技术进步更加剧烈。激光的发明使光谱学进入超高分辨率时代，原子钟把时间测量精度推进到 ","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"key":"Rr0BSNUlYk"},{"type":"span","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"10","key":"zgENaebLtb"},{"type":"superscript","children":[{"type":"text","value":"-18","key":"RmISUKjJuc"}],"key":"ZX3CDPu5pr"}],"key":"hMC5DYsMrX"},{"type":"text","value":" 量级，扫描隧道显微镜让我们第一次\"看见\"单个原子的排列，激光冷却技术把原子速度降到接近绝对零度，使玻色-爱因斯坦凝聚从理论预言变成实验现实。每一项技术都是原子物理的产物，又反过来成为推进原子物理的工具。这种正反馈循环是现代科学最强大的引擎。","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"key":"jbau06t9ls"}],"key":"O0gUQ0eNBu"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1},"end":{"line":53,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"原子物理不是象牙塔里的智力游戏，它是现代文明的底层代码。半导体工业建立在能带理论之上，硅之所以能做半导体，是因为它的能带结构恰好允许通过掺杂来控制导电性，没有量子力学就没有芯片，没有芯片就没有你正在使用的任何电子设备。激光的原理是受激辐射，这是爱因斯坦在 1917 年从量子理论推导出的结果，从光纤通信到激光手术，从条形码扫描到引力波探测，激光无处不在。核能的释放依赖于原子核的结合能曲线，核磁共振成像利用原子核自旋在磁场中的行为，原子钟定义了国际单位制中的\"秒\"，GPS 卫星依赖原子钟的精度来实现定位。量子计算和量子通信正在从实验室走向应用，它们利用叠加和纠缠这些\"最诡异\"的量子特性，有可能在某些问题上实现指数级的加速。理解原子，就是理解我们所生活的技术世界的根基。","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1},"end":{"line":53,"column":1}},"key":"yLUozaSHnU"}],"key":"ZCMkMwI1fw"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"硅基视角：计算作为认知的延伸","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"key":"nzJbHAXft4"}],"identifier":"id","label":"硅基视角：计算作为认知的延伸","html_id":"id-4","implicit":true,"key":"WNUnRWrnDG"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":1},"end":{"line":57,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"人类大脑是进化的产物，它被优化来处理中等尺度、中等速度、中等复杂度的问题：识别捕食者，记住果树的位置，理解同伴的意图。它没有被优化来直观理解 ","position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":1},"end":{"line":57,"column":1}},"key":"OPul5JoEJZ"},{"type":"span","position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":1},"end":{"line":57,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"10","key":"FwTV2iNJjp"},{"type":"superscript","children":[{"type":"text","value":"-10","key":"fEfTRW1z3e"}],"key":"IkUh2fWdOM"}],"key":"dKCDoagEsn"},{"type":"text","value":" 米的世界，没有被优化来想象波函数在高维希尔伯特空间中的演化，没有被优化来追踪多体系统中指数增长的自由度。这是一个根本性的局限。量子力学的数学是精确的，但我们的直觉是模糊的。我们可以写下薛定谔方程，却无法在脑海中\"看见\"波函数的坍缩。我们可以证明纠缠态的存在，却无法\"感受\"两个粒子之间的非定域关联。","position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":1},"end":{"line":57,"column":1}},"key":"dBJPE52PDn"}],"key":"I2Vn6Vy2hu"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":59,"column":1},"end":{"line":59,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"计算机提供了一种补偿。它没有进化包袱，不会被\"常识\"误导。对于计算机来说，波粒二象性不过是同一组数据在时域和频域的不同表示，不确定性原理不过是信号处理中的带宽定理，量子叠加不过是高维向量空间中的线性组合。本书将系统性地使用计算作为理解的工具。当我们用蒙特卡洛方法模拟卢瑟福散射时，我们不只是在\"验算\"公式，而是在用另一种语言重新表述物理过程。当我们数值求解薛定谔方程绘制电子云时，我们不只是在\"画图\"，而是在让抽象的波函数变得可触摸。当我们用符号计算检验角动量的对易关系时，我们不只是在\"做作业\"，而是在体验量子力学的代数结构。代码是现代物理学家的新感官。如果你能把一个物理过程写成程序并让它运行，那说明你的理解已经达到了算法级的精确。","position":{"start":{"line":59,"column":1},"end":{"line":59,"column":1}},"key":"jEnv8qElc1"}],"key":"xlQQv0Ugl3"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":61,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"量子数：原子的身份编码","position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":61,"column":1}},"key":"r2DcVA75b5"}],"identifier":"id","label":"量子数：原子的身份编码","html_id":"id-5","implicit":true,"key":"LMKJJON69g"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"当薛定谔方程被应用于氢原子时，它给出的不仅是能级，还有一套完整的量子数体系。这些量子数不是人为的标签，而是数学方程的自然产物，是对称性和守恒律的体现。主量子数 ","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"key":"VWMgqw2GHd"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"n","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>","key":"PaWpZy3L0X"},{"type":"text","value":" 决定能级的主序列，","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"key":"QkbyRWslVl"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"n=1","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>","key":"WGCLCBEZ2k"},{"type":"text","value":" 是基态，","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"key":"j5o1y39Nri"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"n=2,3,\\ldots","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=2,3,\\ldots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span>","key":"y7jACgGg7J"},{"type":"text","value":" 是激发态。轨道角动量量子数 ","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"key":"uChvqRg7DI"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"l","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"kate